    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to introduce No. 63 Castle View Road. This well located semi-detached home is nestled in the desirable Castle Development of Clondalkin which offers a mature and sought-after setting. With every conceivable amenity on your door step including Clondalkin, Village, the Mill Shopping Centre and a selection of schools, shops, parks and recreational facilities to name a few. Transport links are also excellent, with direct bus routes to Dublin city centre, easy access to the M50 motorway, and the Red Cow Luas stop within walking distance. With internal living accommodation of c. 94 Sqm, this property consists of; entrance porch, living room, dining room and extended kitchen to the ground floor. Upstairs, you will find three bedrooms and a refitted family bathroom. Externally this property boasts a generous, sunny and low maintenance rear garden with garage benefitting from power and lighting and vehicle side access to the front which benefits from a driveway for off road parking. No. 63 comes to the market with a long list of energy upgrades including external insulation wrap, upgraded heating system and upgraded windows throughout. Based on location and opportunity on offer, we know this will be extremely popular so please contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers to register your interest and book a viewing.\n\nKey Features\nBER C2\nc.94 Sqm\nExtended to rear\nHighly sought after location\nNew central heating system\nNo onward chain\nUpgraded windows throughout\nLow maintenance sunny rear garden\nThree bed/One bath\nExternal insulation wrap\nDriveway to front\nClose to a whole host of amenities\nViewing is highly advised!\n\nDirections\nD22 PF89"
      },
      {
